WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.736
Cool! Who are you?

2
00:00:12.737 --> 00:00:16.497
I'm a land hermit crab.

3
00:00:16.498 --> 00:00:21.019
Crabs are crustaceans.

4
00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:23.724
Where do you live?

5
00:00:23.725 --> 00:00:29.055
Land hermit crabs live in tropical areas.

6
00:00:29.056 --> 00:00:33.305
We like sandy beaches.

7
00:00:33.306 --> 00:00:36.363
What do you eat?

8
00:00:36.364 --> 00:00:41.791
Land hermit crabs eat almost anything.

9
00:00:41.792 --> 00:00:47.174
We like leaves, wood, and grass.

10
00:00:47.175 --> 00:00:54.553
I like your claws!

11
00:00:54.554 --> 00:01:00.026
I grab food with my small claw.

12
00:01:00.027 --> 00:01:06.223
I can climb with my big claw.

13
00:01:06.224 --> 00:01:13.023
Why do you have that shell?

14
00:01:13.024 --> 00:01:17.612
A part of our body is soft.

15
00:01:17.613 --> 00:01:24.865
The shell protects that part.

16
00:01:24.866 --> 00:01:28.574
Where do you get your shells?

17
00:01:28.575 --> 00:01:33.350
We find our shells on the beach.

18
00:01:33.351 --> 00:01:37.859
Land hermit crabs grow a lot.

19
00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:43.585
So sometimes we need to find bigger shells!

20
00:01:43.586 --> 00:01:47.142
Do you live alone?

21
00:01:47.143 --> 00:01:51.129
Land hermit crabs live in groups.

22
00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:55.955
We help each other find food and shells.

23
00:01:55.956 --> 00:02:06.385
Shells are hard to find.

24
00:02:06.386 --> 00:02:10.587
I see a bigger shell now!

25
00:02:10.588 --> 00:02:15.393
Good-bye!

26
00:02:15.394 --> 00:02:22.753
Good-bye, Land Hermit Crab!

